			},
			"date": "2023-01-19T08:08:55.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> sooooo…</p><p>11 builds on my MacBook Air M2 with each version (1.0.2 and 2.0.0-beta.1) for my photography site, then I keep the median run times:</p><p>[11ty] Copied 1505 files / Wrote 2516 files in 37.13 seconds (14.8ms each, v1.0.2)</p><p>[11ty] Copied 1505 files / Wrote 2516 files in 38.17 seconds (15.2ms each, v2.0.0-beta.1)</p><p>😅</p><p>2.0.0-beta.1 was much more stable though, from 36.01 to 39.38, while 1.0.2 was from 33.59 to 43.64</p><p>I may have to reboot my Mac between each test, and stop any other app</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
